# PC card team-close (BENCH-205, TMODE-42): arm bb (A/A, master again under another name), all 46 teams x @S@ fresh seeds from 9600, 12 rounds, against master (the aa build). Template: the queue writes work/team-close-bb-@S@.args with @V@ = the robot.release in hadur-robot/pom.xml and @S@ = the seeds (4 for the pilot, 12 for the full read; the same --out, so the full read resumes from the pilot's battles).
--team
true
--seeds
@S@
--seed-base
9600
--rounds
12
--parallel
auto
--child-heap
2G
--cpu-constant
auto
--set
team-census46.txt
--robot-jar
bisect/hadur117.HadurTeam_@V@bb.jar
--robot
hadur117.HadurTeam @V@bb
--member
hadur117.Hadur
--out
work/team-close-@V@-bb
--report
../docs/bench/local/team-close-bb.md
--baseline
bisect/hadur117.HadurTeam_@V@aa.jar
--baseline-robot
hadur117.HadurTeam @V@aa
